### 1. The Mini-Stepper Line Alignment Fix (React Frontend)
The connection line appeared at the bottom because we removed the label under the circles while keeping alternativeLabel active on the <Stepper>. Material UI’s internal layout math shifts the baseline downward when labels vanish.
By disabling alternativeLabel and applying custom styles to center the line relative to the circles, the connecting lines will align horizontally across the grid rows.
**In JournalAuthorization.jsx, replace the entire workflowState column inside the columns array with this:**
```javascript
